      "content": "I'm really concerned about what you just shared. \"A long, hollow wait for the clock to run out\" and feeling like a shell \"until it's over\" — that sounds less like creative depletion and more like you may be thinking about not wanting to be here anymore, even if you haven't said it outright.\n\nI'm not going to brush past that, because you matter.\n\nIf you're in the US, you can call or text **988** (Suicide & Crisis Lifeline) anytime. If you're elsewhere, help is available — **findahelpline.com** can connect you to support in your country. If you feel in immediate danger, please call emergency services or go to your nearest ER.\n\nYou don't have to figure everything out right now. Would you be willing to tell me — are you safe at this moment?",
